\title{fastcramer: fast Cramér multivariate two-sample statistic and permutation tests}
\description{
Computes the Cramér multivariate two-sample statistic of Baringhaus and Franz (2004) \doi{10.1016/S0047-259X(03)00079-4} exactly as the 'cramer' package does, but from three mean pairwise distances evaluated with BLAS matrix products and a fused C++ pass, which is roughly a thousand times faster and scales to thousands of observations per sample. Provides the statistic for all five kernels of 'cramer', a label-permutation test with optional strata, and a bootstrap-versus-blocked-null design for very large samples.
